		""
		""
		"[&l&ePassives&r]:"
		""
		"&6Thought Domination&r [&eTrue Passive&r]"
		""
		"- Gain &6thought acceleration&r and &6telepathy&r skills upon &aobtainment&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"[&l&cModes&r]:"
		""
		"&6Temptation World&r  [&cMode 1&r]"
		""
		"- Enter &ayour&r own &cdomain&r, a &bWorld&r where &6Temptation&r rules. "
		""
		"- Be &cstronger&r and &afaster&r than &canyone&r inside, able to &abuild&r and &csave&r your &bitems&r inside like a &5pocket dimension&r. "
		""
		"- But be &ccareful&r, someone &awith&r the same &6ability&r might try to &cfight&r over &5its&r control."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6Thought Domination&r [&cMode 2&r]"
		""
		"- &6Crouch&r + &cLetter&r for &esub-mode&r."
		""
		"1-> Control the &ctarget&r your &esubordinates&r will &4attack&r, either &afriendly&r, &caggressive&r or just on &ehold&r."
		""
		"1-> Control the &amovement&r of your &esubordinates&r, either &bfully&r stopped, &awandering&r or &efollowing&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6Charm&r [&cMode 3&r]"
		""
		"- Acts as &dCharm&r, place most &ebeings&r by &ayour&r side. Does &cnot work&r the same as &6Naming&r."
		""
		"&6Solicitation&r [&cMode 4&r]"
		""
		"- Acts as &6Possession&r, &csteal&r the &abody&r of most &ccreatures&r. Temporarily &cstealing&r their &6skills&r."
	]
