	quest.019A32EC6A67A324.quest_desc: [
		"- When &aquest&r for &6skill&r has &crequirement&r similar to this: \"&cSlime Killer&r\"."
		""
		"- It means &ayou can&r get it &cby&r most of the time &6Killing 500&r of &cthem."
		""
		"Other ways to obtain skill:"
		"- You can try to &acopy&r it using &6Great Sage&r if you have it"
		"- You can try to &cpredate&r the skill when you have &6Predator&r or &6Glutonny&r (&b10%&r chance or &6100%&r when mob has below &b10%&r HP)"
		"- Or use some other skills like &6Pride&r"
		"- &6Uniques&r are &aObtainable&r just by using &6Pride&r thats why we made &aquests&r for each &6unique&r so you can get &awhich&r you &cwant&r."
		""
		"- Sometimes &6skill&r require &areach&r certain &9EP&r count which &ayou&r can do by &ckilling enemies"
		"- And &bsometimes&r in &border&r to obtain &6skill&r you &ahave&r to first &6master&r other &6skill&r or &6skills&r "
		"Example: ( &bwater current control&r -> &bwater prepulsion&r -> &bwater blade&r )"
	]
