	quest.034421CD3DAE74C6.quest_desc: [
		"There are checkmark quests for skills others then uniques, they serve mostly just for info about skill and so you can &6pin it&r to see what you have to do in order to obtain it while playing."
		""
		"There are currently 3 questlines:"
