		"- Simple questline for &6common skills&r"
		"- And last but not least &6Labyrinth tree&r"
		""
		"There are also some &bRepeatable quests&r which you can do infinite times in order to get reward."
		"There are easier &bRepeatable quests&r from which you get random reward."
		"Or more difficult ones but you can choose reward."
		""
		"And then there is &6original&r quest for each &6unique skill!"
	]
