	quest.08193C86919D422F.quest_desc: [
		""
		""
		"&6[Passive - True]&r &8Ruling Authority&r –  "
		"Grants &aInspiration I&r to all subordinates.  "
		"&7Mastery:&r Grants &aInspiration II&r instead."
		""
		"&6[Passive - Toggle]&r &8Hidden In Darkness&r –  "
		"Removes your presence from the &7TAB&r list.  "
		"Prevents mobs and players from detecting you unless nearby."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Passive - Toggle]&r &8Master of Darkness&r –  "
		"Learn and master all &8Darkness-related&r skills, spells, and battlewills (e.g. Shadow Motion, Formhide, etc.)"
		""
		"&6[Passive - In Slot]&r &8Sound of Silence&r –  "
		"Silences all user-generated sound effects (walking, mining, etc.)."
		""
		"&6[Passive - In Slot]&r &8Shadow Dominance&r –  "
		"Grants bonus &cATK&r and &eSpeed&r at night or in shadows."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &bTrue Copy&r –  "
		"Open a GUI to select one skill from a target (including &6Uniques&r, &3Nullifications&r, &9Resistances&r).  "
		"&7Shift + Use&r to open your skill bank. &cSkill is lost on death&r."
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &aTrue Paste&r –  "
		"Open a GUI to grant a skill from your skill bank to another entity.  "
		"Once pasted, the skill is &cremoved from your bank&r and lasts until the target dies."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &8Darkness Conscription&r –  "
		"Permanently tame a mob if it's in shadows or darkness.  "
		"&cFails in high light levels&r."
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &8Shadow Jump&r –  "
		"&7Shift + Use&r to place a marker in a dark area.  "
		"&7Use&r again while in a dark area to teleport.  "
		"&7Crouch + Use&r on an entity to mark them instead.  "
		"Allows interdimensional jumps to target."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &dPetrichor Stained Destiny&r –  "
		"All subordinates gain &cStrengthen V&r and &eSpeed I&r for 2 minutes.  "
		"&7Crouch + Use&r: Pull all subordinates to your location.  "
		"&2Mastery:&r Effect becomes &cStrengthen X&r and &eSpeed II&r for 5 minutes."
	]
