		"Attacks &cignore all dodge&r.  "
		"Earn &a+10 learn/mastery points&r instead of 1.  "
		"&cNullifications are ignored&r entirely.  "
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active, Press {Toggle on Skill Mastery}]&r &cTrue Chaotic Fate&r –  "
