	quest.08F1AC79217D5325.quest_desc: [
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/unyielding.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r] &lUnyielding&r:"
		""
		"[&bUnyield&r]:"
		""
		"- Once a mob is named by the user, it will gain &b1 Unyielding Point&r each 5s that it’s 30 Blocks around the player, this will decrease if the mob is too far away. "
		"- If a subordinate dies to &cdamage source&r not from the owner, the user will gain &910%&r of the sub’s &9EP&r for each &b120 points&r it has."
		"- The maximum amount of &9EP&r can gain is &9100%&r = &b1200 points&r. "
		"- To gain the fallen subordinates’ &askills&r/&9magics&r/&6arts&r, the sub needs to have at least &b120 points&r for normal &askills&r and &b600 points&r for &6Unique&r Skills."
		""
		"[&l&6Mastery Bonus&r]:"
		""
