		""
		"[&bPassive&r] &lUnyielding&r:"
		""
		"[&6Backup&r]:"
		""
		"- Upon activated, spawn a immobile Body with full &9EP&r and no &aSkill&r at where the user is. "
		"- When activated again, transfer the user’s &6soul&r to where the Body is and spawn a new Body where the user is, swap their &bEquipments&r in &bArmor&r and Hand slots (other slots are untouched) "
		"- Shift activate to remove the backup Body. If the user dies when there’s a backup Body available, automatically transfer them to that Body."
		""
		"[&l&6Mastery Bonus&r]:"
		""
		"- Allows multi-dimensional body transferring "
	]
