	quest.1015FB0C72850869.quest_desc: [
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/predator.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&6Active&r] &lPredator&r:"
		""
		"[&6Predation&r]:"
		""
		"- On use, creates a &bAoE&r &cattack&r in a &b2 Block radius&r in front of the &7player&r. "
		"- If it comes into contact with a &cmob&r, deals &c10 damage&r and drains &9100MP&r, with a 10% chance to gain one random &bIntrinsic&r, &aCommon&r, &eExtra&r, or &bResistance&r &lSkills&r from the target. "
		"- If an &cenemy&r is &ckilled&r by &6Predation&r, gains all of their &bIntrinsic&r, &aCommon&r, &eExtra&r, or &bResistance&r &lSkills&r. "
		"- &cTargets killed&r have &650%&r of their &6EP&r added to the &7players&r instead of the usual &65%&r. "
		"- The other &650%&r will be added to &6Stomach&r's energy storage. "
		"- Shift-activate to &etoggle&r &6consume-block-mode&r, which will automatically be added to &6Stomach&r."
		""
		"[&l&6Mastery Bonus&r]:"
		""
		"- &6Predator&r is capabile of eating &cprojectiles&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/predator.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&6Active&r] &lPredator&r:"
		""
		"[&6Stomach&r]:"
		""
		"- When activated, grants access to a spatial storage with the size of a chest with 7 rows. "
		"- Items are able to be stacked to 128 instead of 64. "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/predator.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&6Active&r] &lPredator&r:"
		""
		"[&6Isolation&r]:"
		""
		"- Consumes &7held item&r and restores &9MP&r similar to &6Absorb and Dissolve&r, but with &9twice&r the &9restored MP&r. "
		"- If nothing is held and the &7player&r is looking at a target, remove all &5negative status effects&r from that target. "
