	quest.12204DF3DC11596C.quest_desc: [
		"&aWelcome Adventurer!&r"
		""
		"&7Message: from the &4Creator&r"
		""
		"Hey! I'm really glad you're here. "
		""
		"My name is &4Wolosmedrah&r and i will be your guide!"
		""
		"Let's &astart&r with &ebasics."
		""
		"As &ayou&r can &esee&r at the &cend&r of this &bbox&r is &earrow&r, that &ameans&r this &cquest&r have &bmultiple&r pages."
		""
		"To &aprogress&r further &cclick&r on the &earrow&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Well done!&r"
		""
		"This &cmodpack&r was &acreated&r with &epurpose&r to &ahelp&r you get &binfo&r about &6tensura world&r, without &cneed&r to &elook&r for &binfo&r on &4wikipedia!"
		""
		"&aWithin&r this &cworld&r i also &eprovide&r you &coption&r to &aobtain&r more &6unique skills!"
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Let's go &atrough&r what this &cmodpack&r has in &4it!"
		""
		"&cWhen&r you &aopen&r your &6quest book&r or press \"&6J&r\" on your &ckeyboard."
		""
		"It &awill&r open &6quests&r in &cwhich&r on &bleft side&r is &6scrollable menu."
		""
		"&6Menu&r is &asorter&r by &csections&r and &4categories&r which &4i&r will &aintroduce&r you &cnow!"
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"First &awe&r have \"&9I'm Not a Bad Slime&r\" category &ewhich&r is basically &6main quest&r line from &astart&r to &cend&r of the &6mod&r"
		""
		"Next is \"&6FAQ&r\" section &bwhich&r provides &aanswer&r to the &emost&r of &cyour questions!"
		""
		"If &esomething&r is &cmissing&r you &acan&r ask me on &cdiscord&r or &4patreon&r and &bit&r will be &aadded&r in &6next update"
		""
		"You &acan&r find &blink&r to &cboth&r in \"&6main menu&r\" or \"&6pause menu\", just &aclick&r the &cbutton."
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"After &ethese&r two &awe&r have \"&6Races&r\" section which &aprovides&r you &binfo&r and &6evolutions&r requirements &cfor&r each &4race"
		""
		"Next is \"&bSkills&r\" which &acontains&r info, &crequirements&r and way to obtain &cevery&r skill and &especial quest&r for each &6unique skill&r to &aobtain it!"
		""
		"Then &awe&r have \"&3Dimensions&r\" which &awe&r have &bcurrently&r two:"
		""
		"- &aLabyrinth tree"
		"- &cHell"
		""
		"You &acan&r find &bdetailed info&r about &cthem&r there."
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Those were &emain features&r of this &6modpack&r and then we have &boptional features&r."
		""
		"The \"&boptional&r\" ones are following:"
		""
		"- &4Freedom Association&r"
		""
		"- &cRe:Zero"
		""
		"- &eMjöllmile's Finances&r"
		""
		"- &6Path of Ascendance"
		""
		""
		"Now &4i&r will &aexplain&r you &bwhat&r is &aeach&r one of &cthem&r for on &6separate page."
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"[&4Freedom Association&r]:"
		""
		"Also known as &4Free Guild&r."
		""
		"Its &apurpose&r is &ctwofold&r, ensuring the &arights&r of its &bmembers&r while also &ekeeping&r the &bpeople&r &asafe&r from &cMonsters."
		""
		"Guild &aprovides&r you &bbasic&r equipment."
		""
		"You &acan&r pick &etask&r of &2your&r choice to &chunt&r down certain &4monsters&r based on your \"&6Rank&r\"."
		""
		"After you &cslay it&r and bring &6trophy&r back to &4guild&r, you &awill&r receive &6rewards&r."
		""
		"And &cif&r you &emeet&r &crequirements&r new \"&6Rank&r\"."
		""
		"&7Pretty simple right?&r"
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"[&cRe:Zero&r]:"
		""
		"This &5section&r provides &ayou&r options to &asummon&r stronger &cenemies&r since &athey&r are quite &6rare."
		""
		"You &ecan&r also exchange &cessences&r and &6evolution&r req. &aitems&r."
		""
		"And &4last&r but not &4least&r you can &eexchange&r your &alevels&r, &emoney&r and &bcrystals&r for certain &aitems&r, &cechantments&r, &4engravements&r or even &6skills"
		""
		"&7Pretty cool right?&r"
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"[&eMjöllmile's Finances&r]:"
		""
		"Since &eyou&r can earn &6gold&r by doing &4guild's tasks&r or from &erewards&r for doing &6quests&r you need &asomething&r to &cspend&r it &bon."
		""
		"You &ecan&r open &6shop&r in your &cinventory&r by using \"&6SDM Shop&r\" icon in &btop left&r coroner or &asimply&r by pressing \"&6K&r\" on your &ckeyboard&r"
		""
		"You can &abuy&r stuff there or &eexchange&r your &6money&r for &cenchantments&r, &4engravements&r, &alevels&r, or even &6skills&r in quest section \"&cRe:Zero&r\""
		""
		"&7Pretty awesome right?&r"
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"[&6Path of Ascendance&r]:"
		""
		"- Are you &cworried&r that in &4the end&r of the &egame&r you &cwont&r have &4nothing&r to &ado&r?"
		""
		"- Well &4i&r have &aplenty&r of &econtent&r for &ayou&r to do for example &abuild&r a &cnation"
		""
		"- Acquire &6Legendary equipment&r"
		""
		"- Forge &6the relic&r of past &cgods&r like &4Veldanava\\'s Crown"
		""
		"- Obtain &4Element Core ( Turn Null )&r which will &aallow you&r to &5shape reality&r to your &dlikings"
		""
		"- &aProve&r your &eworth&r by fighting &6Pinnacles of the World"
		""
		"&7Pretty insane right?&r"
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Thats &babout it&r i hope &cyou&r will &aenjoy&r the &6modpack&r :)"
		""
		"I &ewish&r you &agood&r luck &c<3"
		""
		"And if you &clike&r the &6modpack&r consider &asupporting&r it by &6donation&r which &ayou&r can &efind&r on &5discord"
		""
		"Next is &amore&r info &eabout&r future of &6modpack&r"
		""
		"Please &eclick arrow&r and &awe&r will &bcontinue."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"This &amodpack&r is &cjust small&r part of &4larger project&r im &bworking on!"
		""
		"Name of the project is &6Chronicles of the Omniverse&r."
		""
		"This &6project&r will &2contain&r full &bprogress&r and &6in-game wiki&r for &aevery&r minecraft &cmod&r!"
		""
		"Mods will be &achoosen&r by &cpatreons&r and &4donators&r always &bone&r a &3month"
		""
		"You can &achoose&r which &cmods&r you &ewant&r to &aplay&r with and &cyou&r will get &6quest book&r based on &cthat."
		""
		"It &awill&r also provide &6base&r for &4developers&r and their &4modpack&r where &athey&r can &esimply&r add &crewards&r to &6quests&r as &athey&r see &bfit."
	]
