	quest.18FF0946CFDB60A2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&6[Passive - True]&r &aUnbreakable Will&r –"
		"Grants immunity to psychological effects like &5Insanity&r and &dCharm&r."
		"Negates lethal damage once every &e10 minutes&r, grants &a2s&r invulnerability, and shows a warning when HP hits 0."
		""
		"&6[Passive - In Slot]&r &cConqueror's Might&r –"
		"Physical attacks ignore &6Physical Attack Resistance&r (&cNullification&r is treated as &6Resistance&r)."
		"Deals &b+30% damage&r to &dSpiritual Lifeforms&r."
		""
		"&6[Passive - Toggle]&r &eAcceleration Field&r –"
		"Boosts &cATK SPD&r, &dCast SPD&r, and &aMOV SPD&r by &a15%&r (&b25%&r with Mastery)."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active - Hold]&r &4Kaiser's Dominion&r –"
		"Emits aura causing &cFear&r in &e10 blocks&r for &a10s&r (on release)."
		"Heals allies for &a25 HP/s&r (&a40 HP/s&r with Mastery) and removes all debuffs."
		"Cost: &b5,000 MP/s&r. Cooldown: &a30s&r."
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &cRelentless Echo&r –"
		"Inflicts &eWeakness&r, &7Slowness&r, &cFragility&r, &5Burden&r (Lv.2 / Lv.4 Mastery) to 1 target in &e10 blocks&r."
		"Duration: &a15s&r (&a30s&r Mastery)."
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &6Glorious Verdict&r –"
		"Target in &e20 blocks&r loses &c30% MP \\& AP&r if their EP is &e<25%&r of your Max."
		"If &e>25%&r, reduces &c15% MP \\& AP&r. Only works on targets with &d500K EP&r+."
		"Cost: &b7,500 MP&r. Cooldown: &a20s&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &bInvincible Victory&r –"
		"Grants &a20s&r of invulnerability. Disables HP, MP, AP regen."
		"Applies &cWeakened&r state for &e10s&r after effect ends."
		"Cost: &b15,000 MP&r. Cooldown: &a45s&r."
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &4Conquest&r &7(Requires Mastery)&r –"
		"Unleashes a &e10-block arc slash&r dealing &c2,000 HP&r (100 HP Bars)."
		"Bypasses &6Physical Nullification&r."
		"Cost: &b50,000 MP&r. Cooldown: &a20s&r."
	]
