		""
		"- Give user’s &7physical attack&r with a &3Corrosion effect&r when this mode is &aIn Slot&r. "
		"- When activated while looking at nothing, deals &25 corrosion damage&r every 10 ticks to all enemies in a 10x10 radius. "
		"- Enemies killed by this have their &bIntrinsic&r, &aCommon&r, and &eExtra&r Skills taken by the player as well as have &950%&r of their &9EP&r added to the player's maximum. "
		"- The other &950%&r is added to &6Stomach&r's energy storage."
