	quest.200DB5A407083292.quest_desc: [
		"{image:mysticism:textures/skill/unique/spiritualist.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Passive, Toggle]&r &dChant Reduction&r – If a spell is &cnot mastered&r, your &9cast speed&r is &agreatly increased&r through spirit assistance."
		""
		"&6[Passive, Toggle]&r &dChant Annulment&r – You can cast &amagic instantly&r without chanting if the spell is &bmastered&r."
		""
		"&6[Passive, In Slot]&r &dSpiritfarer&r – Spirits shield you, reducing &dMagic&r and &bSpiritual Damage&r by &a25%&r, and &cPhysical Damage&r by &a10%&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:mysticism:textures/skill/unique/spiritualist.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Passive, In Slot]&r &dLeyline Connection&r – Halves all &9Magicule&r consumption."
		""
		"&6[Passive, True]&r &dHarvester&r – Gain &fSouls&r from kills, &7even without being a Majin&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:mysticism:textures/skill/unique/spiritualist.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &dCarve&r – Spin your &cRitual Scythe&r to &aharvest Souls&r in a small radius.  "
		"The number of souls gained depends on &cDamage Dealt&r.  "
		"&7Cooldown:&r &c10 seconds&r – &aGrants 1 Mastery Point&r per use.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:mysticism:textures/skill/unique/spiritualist.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&7Soul Formula:&r  "
		"(Mainhand Weapon Damage + Base Attack Damage) × Critical Multiplier ÷ 5  "
		"&7(Typical Multiplier: 1.5)&r"
		""
		"&6[Active, Scroll]&r &dEnhance&r – Use your &fSouls&r to empower your next &bMagic or Spiritual Attack&r.  "
		"Hold the key and scroll to set the percentage of souls to consume.  "
		"Damage boost = &bPercentage used +10%&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:mysticism:textures/skill/unique/spiritualist.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&7Example:&r  "
		"- Solar Rain deals 30 × 8 bolts = 240 damage  "
		"- Using 100% souls → +110% = &c63×8 = 504 damage&r  "
		"- Using 50% souls → +60% = &c48×8 = 384 damage&r"
	]
