	quest.22116B767E3FF4AC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/intrinsic/possession.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&6Active&r] &lPossession&r:"
		""
		"- If used while possessing a body, leaves the body and its &bIntrinsic&r &lSkills&r behind and turns the &7player&r into &dSpiritual Form&r. "
		"- When possessing a &ctarget&r, the &7user&r turns back into &7Physical Form&r with the &ctarget’s&r &7physical&r &lStats&r and it's &lSkills&r."
		"- While in &dSpiritual form&r if the &7player&r can possess a &ctarget&r: "
		"[Ineffective against &ctargets&r with &dSpiritual&r &3Nullification&r &etoggled&r]"
		""
		"&lNon-Player Mobs&r:"
		""
		"- At below &a10% HP&r, Below &d10% Spiritual HP&r, or below &625% Maximum EP&r (Relative to the &7user&r) "
		"- Reduce to &a5% HP&r, &d5% SHP&r or &612.5% EP&r if the target has &dSpiritual Attack&r &bResistance&r &etoggled&r."
		""
		"&lPlayer&r: "
		""
		"- Require 2 out of the 3 optional requirements above. "
		"- If possessed, the &ctarget player&r will be put into &dSpiritual form&r and will die eventually without having [&6Possession&r]."
