	quest.2227E21C506CC112.quest_desc: [
		""
		""
		"[&a&lPassives&r]:"
		""
		"&6Silent Death&r [&aTrue Passive&r]:"
		""
		"- The player makes &bzero noise&r, undetectable by &6Sculk&r or &6Sense Sound Wave&r."
		""
		"&6Finality Balance&r [&aTrue Passive&r]:"
		""
		"- Upon &6experiencing&r true &4death&r your &6final&r and &cabsolute&r end &6everything&r within a &b50&r block &bradius&r is &cerased&r from &5existence&r."
		""
		"- &7Nothing remains&r. "
		""
		"- No &etraces&r, no &6emnants&r. "
		""
		"- Only the &c&linevitability&r of &6oblivion&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6Spiritual Force&r [&aPassive | Is Toggled \\& In Slot&r]:"
		""
		"- Go &6invisible&r and &6conceal&r your &apresence&r. On &6servers&r, &6hide&r yourself &cfrom&r the &btab list&r and &6fake&r a &cleaving message&r."
		""
		"&eSpiritual Nullification&r and &6Shadow Motion&r acquired on obtainment."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6Law Manipulation&r [&aPassive | Is Toggled&r]:"
		""
		"- &6Magic Jamming&r mitigation &6ignored&r. "
		" "
		"- &6Nullifications&r are treated as &aResistances&r. "
		" "
		"- &aResistances&r are &6ignored&r.  "
		""
		"- &6Ignores&r &bdodges&r and &6crit damage&r.  "
		""
		"- &aCan fly&r."
		""
		"+&625&r &bSpatial&r and &5Gravity&r damage."
		""
		"- &6Abnormal Condition, Spatial, Gravity Nullifications&r &aacquired&r on &cobtainment."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		""
		"[&c&lModes&r]:"
		""
		"&6Azrael Blade&r [&aMode 1&r]:"
		""
		"- &6Summon&r a &6blade&r that can be wielded only by the vessel of &cAzrael&r.  "
		""
		"- This &6blade&r carries &4death&r itself, &ckilling&r anything with a &bsingle strike&r.  "
		""
		"- However, &6power&r comes at a &6cost&r each &ckill&r drains &b60%&r of your &6health&r, though it cannot reduce your health below &b1 HP&r.  "
		""
		"- The &6blade&r can be used only &b2 times&r before shattering. &cCan't be enchanted&r."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		""
		"&6Angel Virtue&r [&aMode 2&r]:"
		""
		"- Upon &6use&r, you will gain &b5 lives&r.  "
		""
		"- This &6stacks&r with &cAzrael Sacrifice&r and &ccannot be used again&r until all lives are &bdepleted&r.  "
		""
		"- Each &etime&r you &6die&r, one &blife&r will be &cconsumed&r in &ayour&r place, and it'll &6drain&r &b30%&r of your &6health&r.  "
		""
		"- &cNo other penalties&r will be &aincurred&r upon &6death&r."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		""
		"&6Salvation Lord&r [&aMode 3&r]:"
		""
		"- When &6toggled&r, if an &6allied subordinate&r dies within &b50 blocks&r of you, their &6soul&r will linger for &b30 seconds&r, awaiting &6rescue&r.  "
		""
		"- You can &6revive&r their &6soul&r by &6looking&r at it, at the &ccost&r of the &bsubordinate's&r max &9EP&r before their &6death&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		""
		"&6Azrael Sacrifice&r [&aMode 4&r]:"
		""
		"- &cSacrifices&r up to &b5 tamed&r or &bnamed entities&r within a &b50-block radius&r. "
		""
		"- If &cfewer&r than &b5&r are &aavailable&r, the &cmode&r will &aactivate&r once a &btotal&r of &b5&r have been &csacrificed&r. "
		""
		"- Allies &ccannot&r be &cplayers&r.  "
		""
		"- Upon &csacrificing&r your &ballies&r, it'll &cdrain&r &b50%&r of your &ahealth&r and gain the following &6effects&r for &e2 minutes&r: &6Strength&r, &6Health Boost&r, &6Dig Speed&r, and &6Fire Resistance 15&r."
		""
		"- If &6Angel Virtue&r is &cactive&r, the &bnumber&r of &agained&r &6lives&r will &aincrease&r by &b2&r, &6stacking&r with &cany&r remaining &6lives&r."
		""
		"- Sacrificed &btames&r will &cnot&r be &bcounted&r as the &auser's&r kills, &emeaning&r no &6rewards&r will be &agranted&r for &cthem."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		""
		"&6Death Apocalypse&r [&aMode 5&r]:"
		""
		"- &6Death&r surrounds &6all&r within a &b30-block radius&r, ensuring &cno life&r remains &aunscathed&r. "
		""
		"- Anyone &cwho&r dares &4oppose&r their &cinevitable&r end is &ccorroded&r, suffering &c80 damage&r over &btime.  "
		""
		"- For &cthose&r who &bremain&r standing, a &cbarrage&r of debilitating &6effects&r takes hold: &6Insanity&r, &6Burden&r, &6Fragility&r, &6Fear&r, &6Weakness&r, &6Saturation&r, &6Wither&r and &6Spatial Blockage&r."
		""
		"- The &6amplifier&r of these &6effects&r begins at level &b5&r and increases over time, intensifying their torment."
		""
		"- Enemies &ckilled&r by this have all their &6skills&r besides &6Ultimates&r taken by the &aplayer&r as well as have &b100% of their &9EP&r added to the &aplayer's&r maximum."
		""
		"- You'll take &cdamage&r overtime, which begins at &b1%&r and increases with the &6amplifier&r level. "
		""
		"- The &6effect&r lasts for &e3 minutes&r upon activation, and cooldown will only be applied after holding for &e3 minutes&r. &6Corrosion&r will only happen while being held."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6Fallen Power&r [&aMode 6&r]:"
		""
		"With a mere touch, all life within an 80-block radius is erased, leaving nothing behind—no salvation, no second chances. Even the strongest forces cannot undo this absolute annihilation."
		""
		"Bypasses any type of resurrection or immortality."
	]
