		"&7Copying/Stealing&r: &cGiant Ant&r, &cArmy Wasp&r, &cSilver Fish&r, &cBee&r, &cHell Caterpillar&r, &cHell Moths&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:mysticism:textures/skill/intrinsic/exoskeleton.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6[Passive, Hold]&r &bExoskeleton&r - Every &aEP Milestone&r reached grants an &aincrease in Armor&r.  "
		""
		"The resulting armor points are &7rounded down&r and &astack with normal armor&r.  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:mysticism:textures/skill/intrinsic/exoskeleton.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Base Progression:&r  "
		"&7- 0 EP&r: Equivalent to &aMonster Leather D&r ÷ 2 → &a5 Armor Points&r  "
