		"&7- 50,000 EP&r: Equivalent to &aMonster Leather B&r ÷ 2 → &a10 Armor Points&r  "
		"&7- 80,000 EP&r: Equivalent to &aMonster Leather A&r ÷ 2 → &a12 Armor Points&r  "
		"&7- 800,000 EP&r: Equivalent to &aMonster Leather Special A&r ÷ 2 → &a22 Armor Points&r  "
		"&7- 4,000,000 EP&r: Equivalent to &aHihi'irokane Armor&r ÷ 2 → &a28 Armor Points&r  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:mysticism:textures/skill/intrinsic/exoskeleton.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Hardshell Ant Evolution Path Bonus:&r  "
		"If you are of the &2Ant&r race and its evolution path &2Hardshell Ant&r, your armor &cwill not be divided&r. You gain the following &ain addition&r to regular armor:"
