	quest.28DC6D9247C36A22.quest_desc: [
		""
		""
		"&6[Passive, True]&r &aReconstruction&r –  "
		"Should your body be destroyed, fully &areform&r yourself.  "
		"&7Cooldown: 120 seconds&r  "
		""
		"&6[Passive, In Slot]&r &aSelf Replication&r –  "
		"At &c<50% HP&r, generate a clone of yourself.  "
		"- Clones can self-replicate with a decreasing cap:  "
		"  &7Player → 5 → 3 → 1&r  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Passive, In Slot]&r &aOrganic Evolution&r –  "
		"When facing stronger enemies:  "
		"- &e+20% EP&r → &2Strengthen III&r, &aResistance I&r  "
		"- &e+40% EP&r → &2Strengthen VI&r, &aResistance II&r  "
		"- &e+60% EP&r → &2Strengthen IX&r, &aResistance III&r  "
		"- &e+80% EP&r → &2Strengthen XII&r, &aResistance IV&r  "
		"- &e+100% EP&r → &2Strengthen XV&r, &aResistance IV&r  "
		""
		"&6[Passive, Toggle]&r &aAdaptive Evolution&r –  "
		"Taking damage increases resistance learn rate  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Passive, Toggle]&r &aRegeneration&r –  "
		"Heal &dHP&r and &bMP&r passively when out of combat  "
		""
		"&6[Passive, Toggle]&r &aAdaptive Observation&r –  "
		"Gain &e+5 Learn/Mastery Points&r for all skills, magic, and battlewills  "
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &cOrganic Distortion&r –  "
		"- Deals &c500 damage&r and applies &6Distortion III&r (10s)  "
		"- &6Distortion Effects&r:  "
		"  - Disables flight  "
		"  - +0.6 gravity / level  "
		"  - −1.5 attack dmg / level  "
		"  - −0.075 move speed / level  "
		""
		"&6[Active, Hold]&r &cAnatomy Manipulation&r –  "
		"- Scroll to change your body size  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &5Adaptive Replication&r –  "
		"- Copy a &brandom intrinsic/common/extra&r skill  "
		"- &6If Unique&r: gain it for &e180s&r (&a300s on mastery&r)  "
		"&7Cooldown: 120 seconds&r  "
	]
