		"&dIncludes bosses.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &cAmplify&r – Requires &cDevourer&r to be active.  "
		"Doubles all &cDevourer buffs&r for &a2 minutes&r at a cost of &b300 MP&r.  "
		"Press again while active to &adash&r in your view direction, dealing:"
