	quest.3DE31E4FF4F43FFD.quest_desc: [
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/gluttony.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r] &lGluttony&r:"
		""
		"[&6Predation&r]:"
		""
		"- On use, creates a &bAoE &cattack&r up to a &a10 Block radius&r (slideable range with scroll mouse) in front of the &7player&r."
		"- If it comes into contact with a &cmob&r, deals &c50 damage&r, applies &5Corrosion&r for &l100 Ticks&r, and drains &91,000MP&r, with a 30% chance to gain 1-3 random &bIntrinsic&r, &aCommon&r, &eExtra&r, or &bResistance&r &lSkills from the &ctarget&r. "
		"- If an &cenemy&r is killed by &6Predation&r, gains all of their &bIntrinsic&r, &aCommon&r, &eExtra&r and &bResistance&r &lSkills."
		"- If a &cMagic projectile&r is eaten, then the &7player&r gains that &9magic&r (consumed attacks have their &6EP&r added to &6Stomach&r's energy storage). "
		"- &cTargets killed&r/&ccorpses&r eaten have &680%&r of their &6EP&r added to the players instead of the usual &65%&r. "
		"- The other &620%&r will be added to &6Stomach&r's energy storage. "
		"- Can be toggled to consume &7blocks&r, which will automatically be added to &6Stomach&r."
		""
		"[&l&6Mastery Bonus&r]"
		""
		"- Increases &bradius&r to &b15 Block&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/gluttony.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r] &lGluttony&r:"
		""
		"[&6Stomach&r]:"
		""
		"- When activated, grants access to a spatial storage with the size of a chest with 9 rows. "
		"- Items are able to be stacked to 666 instead of 64."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/gluttony.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r] &lGluttony&r:"
		""
		"[&6Isolation&r]:"
		""
		"-  Consumes &7held item&r and restores &9MP&r similar to &bAbsorb and Dissolve&r, but with &9twice&r the &9restored MP&r. "
		"- If nothing is held and the &7player&r is looking at a &ctarget&r, remove all &5negative status effects&r from that target. "
		"- If used while empty handed and not looking at a mob, removes all &5negative status effects&r from the &7player&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/gluttony.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r] &lGluttony&r:"
		""
		"[&6Corrosion&r]:"
		""
		"- Deals &210 Corrosion&r damage&r every &l10 Ticks&r to &call enemies&r in a &b10x10 radius&r. "
		"- &cEnemies killed&r by this have their &bIntrinsic&r, &aCommon&r, and &eExtra&r &lSkills&r taken by the &7player&r as well as have &680%&r of their &6EP&r added to the &7player's&r &6maximum&r and the other &620%&r is added to &6Stomach."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/gluttony.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r] &lGluttony&r:"
		""
		"[&bReceive&r]:"
		""
		"- &bIntrinsic&r, &aCommon&r, and &eExtra&r &lSkills&r owned by the &7player's &9subordinates&r are given to the &7player&r."
	]
	quest.3DE31E4FF4F43FFD.quest_subtitle: "- Mastered &6Predator&r + Have &6Starved&r"
	quest.3DE31E4FF4F43FFD.title: "&l&6Gluttony&r"
