	quest.511132ECD8A67BAE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/great_sage.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r - &eToggle&r]: &lGreat Sage&r:"
		""
		"[&bThought &eAcceleration&r]:"
		""
		"- Increase &9magic casting&r speed multiplier by &92&r, increase &emovement speed&r by &e0.01&r, increase &2attack speed&r by &20.2&r."
		""
		"Credit: &6Bader"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/great_sage.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r - &eToggle&r]: &lGreat Sage&r:"
		""
		"[&6Analytical Appraisal&r]:"
		""
		"&lAnalysis Level 2&r:"
		""
		"- When &6activated&r, creates a screen overlay that displays information about the currently looked at &lBlock&r or &cmob&r in a &b20 Block radius&r. "
		"- Displays &7Name&r, &aHP&r, &9MP&r, &eAP&r, &bArmor&r, etc."
		"- Displays the &lSkills&r of the &ctarget&r except for &6mastered&r &lSkills&r."
		"- If a &ctarget&r has &6greater&r than &62x&r the &7player's&r &6EP&r, then only its base stats are shown (&7Name&r, &aHP&r, &9MP&r, &eAP&r, &bArmor&r)."
		""
		"[&l&6Mastery Bonus&r]:"
		""
		"- Increases &bdistance&r to &b30 Block&r."
		""
		"Credit: &6Bader"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/great_sage.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r - &eToggle&r]: &lGreat Sage&r:"
		""
		"[&bParallel Processing&r]:"
		""
		"- Increases the amount of Learned Points and Mastery Points gained when learning/using &lSkills&r, &9Magic&r, &6Battlewill&r, and &3Arts&r by 9."
		""
		"Credit: &6Bader"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/great_sage.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r - &eToggle&r]: &lGreat Sage&r:"
		""
		"[&bChant&r &eAttunement&r]:"
		""
		"- For &9Mastered Magic&r, completely fills up the Magic Circle's &9MP meter&r instantly."
		""
		"Credit: &6Bader"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/great_sage.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&bPassive&r - &eToggle&r]: &lGreat Sage&r:"
		""
		"[&6Analysis&r]:"
		""
		"- When used while looking at a &cmob&r, copies 1 of the &9Magic&r, and &lSkills&r (Except &6Unique Skills&r \\& &bResistances&r) of a target. "
		"- Ineffective against &cUltimate Skill&r &7Users&r. "
		"- 25% Chance at Success."
		"- When looking at nothing, opens up a GUI that can craft or refine items with increased stack numbers."
		""
		"&lCrafting Tab&r: "
		"- Works like a normal crafting table. "
		"- Put an item in the copy slot on the left, to craft that item like a smithing bench without the need of Schematics, the user can copy that item just by having the materials in the crafting grid. "
		"- Has a button on the right to auto craft desired items."
		""
		"&lRefining Table&r:"
		"- Brewing any potions like brewing stand but all at once."
		"- If a &7Hipokute Grass&r is placed into a slot with any bottle, it brews into a &bHigh Potion&r. "
		"- If a &7Hipokute Flower&r is placed into a slot with any bottle, it brews into a &bFull Potion&r. "
		"- If a &7Magic Ore&r is placed into a slot, refine it into &7Pure Magisteel Nuggets&r."
		""
		"[&l&6Mastery Bonus&r]:"
		""
		"- Increases copy chance to 50%"
		""
		"Credit: &6Bader"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/great_sage.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&6TIP&r]:"
		""
		"- With &6BTRUltima mod&r you can &again&r it by consuming &b250x Wisdom Shard"
	]
