	quest.535099B09F611E13.quest_desc: [
		""
		""
		"&6[Passive - Toggle]&r &ePredictive Calculation&r –  "
		"- &a50%&r Chance to &dDodge&r  "
		"- &a75%&r Chance to &cIgnore Enemy Dodge&r  "
		"- &a100%&r Critical Damage  "
		"- &3Nullification&r is treated as &3Resistance&r  "
		"- &3Resistance&r is bypassed  "
		"- Ignores &5Magic Jamming&r damage mitigation  "
		""
		"&6[Passive - Toggle]&r &8Silent Movement&r –  "
		"- Become completely silent  "
		"- Undetectable by &9Sculk&r or &bSense Sound Wave&r  "
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active - Hold]&r &cAssassination&r –  "
		"- Gain complete &7invisibility&r and &9sensor immunity&r  "
		"- Deal &c+300 Physical&r (&c+650 Mastery&r) and &d+500 Spiritual&r (&d+750 Mastery&r) bonus damage  "
		"- &7Cost: 300 MP per second&r  "
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &5Dispel&r –  "
		"- Apply &5Magic Jamming&r to all in &a20 blocks&r (&a30 with mastery&r)  "
		"- Remove all magic effects on user  "
		"- &7Cost: 1000 MP, Cooldown: 5s (3s Mastery)&r  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &4Eraser&r –  "
		"- Reduce MP/AP based on EP difference:  "
		"  - &c<10% EP&r → 100% drain  "
		"  - &c10–25% EP&r → 50% drain  "
		"  - &c25–50% EP&r → 25% drain  "
		"  - &c>50% EP&r → 10% drain  "
		"- &7Guaranteed hit in melee, Cost: 10k MP, Cooldown: 20s (10s Mastery)&r  "
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &4Necrosis&r –  "
		"- Apply &4Necrosis&r: disables regen and magic use for 2m (4m Mastery)  "
		"- &7Range: 20 blocks, Cost: 15k MP, Cooldown: 30s (20s Mastery)&r  "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &cRemove&r –  "
		"- Instantly destroys the target’s &eBarriers&r  "
		"- &7Cost: 5k MP, Cooldown: 5s (3s Mastery)&r  "
		""
		"&6[Active - Press]&r &cJudgement&r (Mastery + Learned) –  "
		"- &eBarrier Destruction&r + Apply &4Necrosis&r  "
		"- Target loses &c75% EP&r (37.5% MP, 37.5% AP)  "
		"- Deals &c750 Physical&r and &d1000 Spiritual Damage&r  "
		"- &7Cost: 25k EP, Cooldown: 20 minutes&r  "
	]
