	quest.55030C7A42C2828F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/beelzebuth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&a&lPassives&r]:"
		""
		"&6Soul Drain&r [&aIn Slot&r]:"
		"- &6Soul Drain&r effect for &b6secs&r on &chit."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/beelzebuth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		"[&c&lModes&r]:"
		""
		""
		"&6Predation&r [&aMode 1&r]"
		""
		"- &cConsume&r and &6absorb&r anything in &ayour&r path with a &bradius&r of &b3&r to &b30&r blocks, &cstealing&r their &6skills&r and &cpower&r (Not &6Uniques&r/&cUltimates&r)."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/beelzebuth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Corrosion&r [&aMode 2&r]"
		""
		"- Deals &c65 Corrosion&r damage every &b10 ticks&r to &call enemies&r within a &b30x30&r radius."
		""
		"- Enemies &ckilled&r by &bthis&r have their &bIntrinsic&r, &aCommon&r, and &eExtra Skills&r taken &cby&r the &aplayer."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/beelzebuth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Soul Consumption&r [&aMode 3&r]"
		""
		"- Instantly &ckills all mobs&r within a &b30x30 radius&r that are below &a90% HP&r, have an &9EP&r below &b90%&r of the &ausers&r maximum, or &ahave&r a &elvl 3&r or &6higher&r fear &cdebuff."
		""
		""
		"&6Imaginary Space&r [&aMode 4&r]"
		""
		"- A &6storage&r with almost &binfinite&r space."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/beelzebuth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Mimicry&r [&aMode 5&r]"
		""
		"- Soon."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/beelzebuth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Isolation&r [&aMode 6&r]"
		""
		"- Consumes &cheld&r item and &arestores&r &9mp&r similar to &6Absorb and Dissolve&r, but with &btwice&r the &arestored &9mp&r. "
		""
		"- If &bnothing&r is &cheld&r and the &aplayer&r is &blooking&r at a &ctarget&r, &6remove all&r negative &astatus&r effects &bfrom&r that &ctarget&r. "
		""
		"- If &aused&r while &bempty handed&r and &bnot looking&r at a &cmob&r, &6removes all&r negative &astatus&r effects from the &aplayer&r [Costs &9100 MP&r each effect &blevel&r removed]"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/beelzebuth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Receive&r [&aMode 7&r]"
		""
		"- &aReceive&r the &6skills&r from any &bsubordinate&r immediately."
	]
