	quest.5A00DA96EC533FF3.quest_desc: [
		"[&6Blacksmith&r] &bSunWine&r:"
		"  "
		"\"Well, well... If it isn’t one of the realm’s finest gracing my humble forge. An &bS-Rank&r adventurer, no less. The stories didn’t lie, you’ve got the air of a legend about you.\""
		""
		"\"Welcome to the &l&bCelestial Forge&r, where steel meets the divine and mortal hands shape the tools of gods and heroes. I’m &bSunWine&r, the smith who turns myths into metal.\""
		""
		"\"You wouldn’t be here if you were after some common blade. No, you’re here for something worthy, something that'll truly be fit for a person of your power\""
		""
		"\"So tell me, hero... what kind of legend do you need me to forge for you? A weapon that splits the heavens? Impenetrable Armor? Just say the word, and I'll do my best to make it a reality\""
	]
	quest.5A00DA96EC533FF3.quest_subtitle: "- Requires [&bS&r] - Rank Missions unlocked"
	quest.5A00DA96EC533FF3.title: "&l&bThe Celestial Forge&r"
