	quest.5EE5AA4F444FD7A1.quest_desc: [
		""
		""
		"&6[Passive, Toggle]&r &8Soulscape&r – Upon killing an entity, its &7soul lingers&r for &a30 seconds&r.  "
		"You may choose to keep or release it.  "
		""
		"&6[Passive, True]&r &8Essence of Eclipse&r – At &9night&r, all &8Shadow Warriors&r gain increased &cDamage&r and &eSpeed&r.  "
		"During the &eDay&r, they gain &7Armor&r and &7Armor Toughness&r.  "
		"&7Does not affect the player unless a condition is met. See &b[Shadow Merge]&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Passive, In Slot]&r &8Rewrite Fate&r – If death occurs, it is rewritten at the cost of &c25% MP&r (&a20% on Mastery&r).  "
		"The user is then teleported near the attacker."
		"  "
		"&4Susano’o: Fantasy Destruction&r &7ignores this and kills you outright.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &8Shadow Warrior&r – Create a &8Shadow Warrior&r from a &7lingering soul&r at the cost of the &cTarget's EP&r (now consumes &eCurrent MP&r instead of Max MP).  "
		"&dIncludes Otherworlders&r. &cBosses excluded&r. "
		""
		"Warriors are &apermanent, loyal subordinates&r."
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &8Shadow Storage&r – Store any subordinate into an &7item form&r. "
		" "
		"&7Right-click&r the ground to re-summon them."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &8Shadow Merge&r – While holding a stored subordinate, merge to &again their stats and EP&r.  "
		""
		"Press again to &dexit merge&r and return the subordinate to item form. "
		" "
		"&4Death while merged&r results in &cpermanent loss&r of the subordinate."
		"  "
		"&8Essence of Eclipse&r applies to the player while merged."
	]
