	quest.663B816AB56E2D48.quest_desc: [
		"&cQ.) How do you change skill presets?"
		""
		"&a- Alt + Scroll or Alt + Preset 2/3/4/5 etc..."
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) How do I change skill mode?"
		""
		"&a- Alt + Ability button"
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) How do I get out of Hell?"
		""
		"&a- Find a Hell Gate to the Overworld"
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) How do I get past the colossus boss room, there was no boss?"
		""
		"&a- Someone probably took the Block of Pure Magisteel; "
		""
		"&a- you need to drop a (new) Block of Pure Magisteel in the center of the room"
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) \"How/ Can I get more Unique Skills? \""
		""
		"&a- unless you have Pride; Spearhead; Possession, you cannot"
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) How do I get magic?"
		""
		"&a- Go into the labyrinth and pray at the spirit tree."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&cQ.) How do I get [insert resistance]?"
		""
		"&a- Get hit by the desired damage type for over 10+ damage."
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) How do I allow myself to be named?"
		""
		"&a- Shift + N"
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) How do I name a mob?"
		""
		"&a- Weaken it and then press N while looking at it"
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) How do you activate a Charybdis Core?"
		""
		"&a- By killing mobs near it it will slowly gain EP (Checkable with skill or picking it up) and once it gets to 100k EP, right click it to summon Charybdis."
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) How do I turn the Orc Lord into a Orc Disaster"
		""
		"&a- Have the Orc lord kill mobs around it, it will gain ep from the mobs it kills, once it reaches 200k Ep it will automatically evolve into a Orc Disaster"
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) Where do I find Monster Leather (A)?"
		""
		"&a- Monster leather A only drops from Blade Tigers, which is found in forest biomes"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&cQ.) What are the requirements to possession?"
		""
		"&a- For mobs: 10% HP or less, 10% SHP or less, or 25% Target's EP relative to your EP"
		""
		"&a- To possess a players, need to meet 2/3 of the above requirements."
		""
		""
		"&cQ.) Where do otherworlders spawn?"
		"&a- Otherworlders can spawn in these Vanilla biomes: "
		""
		"- Plains"
		""
		"- Snowy plains"
		""
		"- Sunflower plains"
		""
		"- Meadow"
		""
		"- Desert"
		""
		"- Badlands"
		""
		"- Windswept hills"
		""
		"- Sparse jungle"
		""
		"- Savanna plateau"
		""
		"- Badlands."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&cQ.) How do I evolve into TDL (True Demon Lord)/ TH (True Hero)?"
		""
		"&a- True Hero:"
		"Hero Egg: You need to be a not-default-Majin Race (so no Slime/Vampire/Wight, but Majin goblin/Beastman/Etc. works) and you need to have at least 6 out of 7 GreaterSpirits(This can be done over time, does not need to happen all at once.)"
		"Awakening: Have the Hero Egg, you will awaken to a True Hero when you regenerate HP while under 25% of your max while fighting a boss (Orc Lord/ Disaster, Super Massive Slime, Wither, Ender Dragon) which has at least 400k EP (40 armor points [the shield icons]) that is at 50% HP or less. This happens automatically"
		""
		"&a- True Demon Lord:"
		"Demon Lord Seed: Be a Majin (Yellow Race name) and have 200k EP"
		"Majin can be acquired in 4 main ways"
		"Use a Marionette Heart (Found in Ancient City chests)"
		"Die to Magicule Poisoning (have more Magicules than your Max) (5%)"
		"Die to Demon Lord’s Haki (5%)"
		"Start as a Majin Race (Slime/Vampire/Wight/Lesser Daemon)"
		"Awakening: have 10k souls and use the button in Evo menu"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&cQ.) What are all the commands?"
		"/nameable commands to set if you want to be named."
		""
		"/tensura get spirit (without any number behind) will show all of the player's spirits."
		""
		"/skill storage skillName - to quickly open the skill's stomach."
		""
		"/skill storage add skillName - to quickly add the items in main hand to the skill's stomach."
		""
		"/tensura edit forceevo, can force evolve you race or awakening, no matter if you are already awakened or not"
		""
		"/engrave [Username] tensura:slotting [1 - 3] - adds slotting enchant"
		""
		"/engrave [Username] - lets you add TR enchants to items"
		""
		"/tensura worldData trulyUnique list to check for list of Skills taken."
		""
		"/tensura edit ability toggle to force toggle other's abilities."
		""
		"/skill (all/unique/resistance/etc) and magic for /skill toggle along with everything."
		""
		"/tensura worldData trulyUnique list remaining to check for skills that haven't been taken."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Q.) \"What does (effect) do?\""
		""
		"Paralysis - decreases movement speed per level"
		""
		"Fatal Poison - Strong Poison Effect"
		""
		"Insanity - hear random scary sounds, items in inventory have a chance to randomly move around and have nightmares when sleeping."
		"Level 2+ - If in shadow/ darkness, will take Physical damage and Spiritual damage"
		""
		"Fear - At level 1, hear a heartbeat sound. From level 2 onward, get speed debuff for each level; From level 5-9, actively avoid the source and take Insanity damage; From level 10, start taking armor-ignoring damage for each level every few seconds."
		""
		"Corrosion - damages SHP (Spiritual HP) and armor/ tools"
		""
		"Burden - increases weight, preventing jumping"
		""
		"Strengthen - gives Strength 2 per level"
	]
	quest.663B816AB56E2D48.title: "&6Frequently asked Questions"
	quest.66427380360DE5E0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:tensura:textures/skill/unique/thrower.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
