		"[&bPassive&r - &eToggle&r] &lThrower&r:"
		""
		"[&6Throw&r]:"
		""
		"- When activated, consumes the currently held item and creates a projectile with its texture as a model. "
		"- The projectile deals &c50 damage&r boosted with &5Gravity Manipulation&r/&5Domination&r &etoggled&r by &c2x/3x damage&r, if the item is a &bWeapon&r, then it deals its &cnormal damage&r too. "
		"- If used with an empty hand, creates an air projectile that deals &c30 damage&r. "
		"- If activated while looking at an enemy within 2 blocks of the player, flings them 15 blocks instead (further with &5Gravity Manipulation&r/&5Domination&r &etoggled&r)."
		""
