		""
		"&6[Active, Press (500 MP)]&r &9Stagnate&r – Sets the &etarget’s velocity to 0&r for &a10 seconds&r, freezing them in midair if they were &ffalling or flying&r.  "
		"&7Useful for control and punish setups.&r"
		""
