	quest.697D812AA4710667.quest_desc: [
		"[&6???&r] &bSunWine&r:"
		"  "
		"\"Well, well… If it isn’t one of the realm’s finest, stepping into my domain. An &bS-Rank&r adventurer, no less. The weight of your power clings to you like a second shadow, impressive.\""
		""
		"\"Welcome to the &l&cCrucibel of Power&r, where the worthy rise and the unworthy fade into forgotten echoes. The name's &bSunWine&r, and I can grant you power beyond your wildest dreams... if you can pass my trials that is\""
		""
		"\"So tell me, hero… are you ready to face what lies ahead? Are you prepared to prove that your spirit is unyielding, your purpose unshakable? Step forward, and let's see if you're worthy of the power that awaits.\""
	]
