	quest.6EBCA14F5B8E6E09.quest_desc: [
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&l&ePassives&r]:"
		""
		"+50 &6Spatial/Wind/Fire Damage&r"
		""
		"&6Void Vacuum&r [&eIn Slot&r]"
		""
		"- Gives a &btotal&r of &620 SHP&r dmg &btick&r, corrosion &cdmg&r and &4fear 4&r effects for &b30secs&r on &chit&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Point Zero&r [&eIn Slot&r]"
		""
		"- Instantly &cbreaks&r any &bbarrier&r. "
		""
		"- Nullifications are &etreated&r as &cnon-existent&r. "
		""
		"- Ignores &cdodges&r and &4crit damage&r. "
		""
		"- &5Spatial Blockage&r is &cignored&r. "
		""
		"- Bypasses &6Holy Field&r and &6Infinity Prison&r"
		""
		"- &4Immune&r to &6Time Stop&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Matter Repulsion&r [&eIs Toggled&r]"
		""
		"- &cEntities&r in the &eradius&r of &b10 blocks&r get &cpushed&r away. "
		""
		"- Every &cnot allied&r entity that gets &b5 blocks&r close and is &c1% weaker&r than the &aplayer&r or that is &b10% below&r their &amax HP&r, will &6immediately&r die. "
		""
		"- Every &cprojectile&r (Not &6Magic&r) or &4physical attack&r is &cignored&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Isolation&r [&eTrue Passive&r]"
		""
		"- &6Cleans&r every &charmful effect&r from the &aplayer&r."
		""
		""
		"&6Dragon Unification&r [&eTrue Passive&r]"
		""
		"- Upon acquiring &4Azathoth&r, your &9EP&r will &aincrease&r by a &2grand&r total of &b162.000.000&r, divided by &6Aura&r and &9MP&r, each &b82.000.000&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"[&l&cModes&r]:"
		""
		"&6Darkness Gravity Vortex&r [&cMode 1&r]"
		""
		"- Create a &4black hole&r that expands &ccontinuously&r, pulling &aeveryone&r in &b50 radius&r blocks as it &4absorbs&r &ceverything&r and &aeveryone&r below &b5%&r of your &9maximum EP&r around, dealing &c20.000 damage&r and draining &9200.000MP&r from those who are &astronger&r in &b10 base&r + &a40 max&r power &bradius&r blocks. "
		""
		"- The &alonger&r you &chold it&r, the less &bcooldown&r you'll obtain."
		""
		"- Gaining &6100%&r of their &9EP&r by the &efirst time&r. "
		""
		"- It's &cabsorption&r getting &abigger&r as it's &2size&r does. "
		""
		"- Feed it &buntil&r it &cexplodes&r into his &4disappearance&r from &5reality&r, &ceaten&r by it's &aown&r power, only leaving &6chaos&r behind. "
		""
		"- Acquire any &6Ultimate skill&r and &ebelow&r with this &4power&r that was &agiven&r, but &cdo not&r allow it to get into &ayour&r mind as &athy&r is &bonly&r a &evessel&r to &4Azathoth&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Soul Consumption&r [&cMode 2&r]"
		""
		"- Kill &eanything&r below &b5%&r of your &9maximum EP&r or that is with &b10%&r below their &amax HP&r that defies &6you&r in the &bradius&r of &b40 blocks&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		"&6Gluttony&r [&cMode 3&r]"
		""
		"- &cConsume&r and &4absorb&r anything in &ayour&r path with a &eradius&r of &b3 to 50&r blocks, &cstealing&r their &6skills&r, acquire any &6Ultimate&r and &ebelow&r with this &4power&r, dealing &c5.000 damage&r and draining &950.000MP&r from &athose&r who are &2stronger&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Nihility Collapse&r [&cMode 4&r]"
		""
		"- Weapon &cattacks&r deal &bfour times&r their &cnormal damage&r for &b10 minutes&r."
		""
		""
		"&6Imaginary Space&r [&cMode 5&r]"
		""
		"- &cCrouch&r + &6Letter&r for &esub-mode&r."
		""
		"1 -> A &6storage&r with &balmost&r infinite &5space&r."
		""
		"2 -> A &6dimension&r under &ayour&r control, &abuild&r, &cdestroy&r as &ayou&r prefer. "
		""
		"- It's &6infinite&r space, &cnever-ending&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:trnightmare:textures/skill/ultimate/azathoth.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
		""
		"&6Multidimensional Barrier&r [&cMode 6&r]"
		""
		"- Acquire &b10 times&r your &amax hp&r as &bbarrier points&r while also &ccancelling&r most &4damage sources&r with &9lower MP&r cost (&b15.000&r Base + &cdamage taken&r)."
		""
		""
		"&6Spacetime Domination&r [&cMode 7&r]"
		""
		"- &cCrouch&r + &6Letter&r for &esub-mode&r."
		""
		"1 -> &6Time Stop"
		""
		"2 -> &6Time Warp"
		""
		"3 -> &6Instant Motion"
	]
