	quest.7260DA15B4E49F39.quest_desc: [
		"[&l&cTrue Demon Lord]:"
		""
		"&6Demon Lord Seed&r: Be a &eMajin&r (Yellow Race name) and have &9200k EP"
		""
		"&eMajin&r can be acquired in &a4 main ways:"
		"- Use a &aMarionette Heart&r (Found in &6Ancient City&r chests)"
		"- Die to &6Magicule Poisoning&r (have more &9Magicules&r than your Max) (5%)"
		"- Die to &cDemon Lord’s Haki&r (5%)"
		"- Start as a &eMajin&r Race (&aSlime&r/&6Vampire&r/&bWight&r/&cLesser Daemon&r)"
		""
		"&6Awakening&r: have &610,000 souls&r and use the &abutton&r in Evo menu"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"[&a&lTrue Hero&r]:"
		""
		"&aHero Egg&r:"
		"- You need to be a not-default-Majin Race (so no &aSlime&r/&6Vampire&r/&bWight&r/&cLesser Daemon&r, but &eMajin&r &agoblin&r/&cBeastman&r/&bEtc. works&r)"
		"- And you need to have at least &c6&r out of &a7&r &6Greater Spirits&r (This can be done over &btime&r, does &cnot&r need to happen all at &bonce&r.)"
