	quest.79F8531C57E60DC0.quest_desc: [
		""
		""
		"&6[Passive, Toggle]&r &8Soulscape&r – Killing any entity has a &a25% chance&r (&a50% on Mastery&r) to cause their &7soul to linger&r briefly.  "
		"You have &a30 seconds&r to choose whether to keep the soul.  "
		""
		"&6[Passive, True]&r &8Essence of Night&r – At &9night&r, all &8Shadow Warriors&r gain increased &cDamage&r and &eSpeed&r.  "
		"&7Does not affect the player unless a special condition is met.&r  "
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &8Shadow Warrior&r – While looking at a lingering soul, create a &8Shadow Warrior&r version of that mob.  "
		""
		"&cPermanently consumes the target’s EP&r, &4reducing your Max MP&r by the same amount. "
		" "
		"Works on &dOtherworlders&r but not &cbosses&r. Shadow Warriors are permanent &asubordinates&r loyal to you."
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &8Shadow Storage&r – Store any &asubordinate&r you’re looking at into an &7item form&r.  "
		"&7Right-click&r the ground to re-summon them."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		""
		"&6[Active, Press]&r &8Shadow Merge&r – While holding a subordinate in item form, merge with them, &againing their stats and EP&r.  "
		""
		"Pressing the skill again &creverses the merge&r and returns the subordinate to item form.  "
		"&cDying while merged&r results in &4permanent loss&r of the subordinate.  "
		""
		"While merged, &8Essence of Night&r also applies &ato the player&r."
	]
