	quest.7AE2F3F84DDF3BEB.quest_desc: [
		"[&4Guild Master&r] &6Fuze&r:"
		""
		"Even among legends, your name resounds louder."
		""
		"Your deeds have shattered the limits of S-Class—there’s no rank beyond this in our records… but you have become the exception."
		""
		"Today, you ascend to a myth none dared to imagine."
		"A title forged solely to contain your overwhelming existence"
		""
		"Because of you, I had to invent a new rank."
		"There was nothing beyond S-Class—until now."
		"You are now [&bSS&r] Class&r."
		""
		"The world won't just look to you for hope."
		"It will fear what happens when you fall."
	]
